OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin with
OL,6,Fmist or freezing fog patches, these
OL,7,Fwill be slow to clear. Most places
OL,8,Fwill stay dry throughout the day with
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells increasing once
OL,10,Fany fog clears.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening and night will
OL,13,Fcontinue mostly dry with clear spells
OL,14,Fand light winds leading to some mist
OL,15,For freezing fog patches.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FDry and bright with sunny
OL,18,Fspells. A band of cloud and blustery,
OL,19,Flocally heavy and wintry showers will
OL,20,Fspread south from the late afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
