OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,6,Fwith the occasional blustery and
OL,7,Fwintry shower Thursday. Less cold with
OL,8,Fshowery rain spreading south Friday
OL,9,Fbecoming breezy with increasing
OL,10,Foutbreaks of showery rain late
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
